<p>Commercial electrical marketing is not about being found. It is about being invited. General contractors, property managers, and facility directors do not search Google for "commercial electrician" when they have a $300,000 project. They call the three contractors they already know and trust.</p>
<p>Your job is to become one of those three.</p>
