<li>Created dedicated EV charger landing pages for each Austin suburb</li>
<li>Published a "Complete Guide to EV Charger Rebates in Central Texas" that ranked #1 for local rebate searches</li>
<li>Offered same-day quotes and next-day installation for simple jobs</li>
<li>Tracked every lead source and doubled down on highest-ROI channels</li>
</ol>
<p>Results after 18 months: 340 EV charger installations, average ticket $2,800 (including 40% panel upgrades), 40% market share in their primary service area, and a waiting list during peak months.</p>
